# Normalize line endings across platforms.
#
# Text files are stored as LF in the repository and checked out as LF on every
# platform (including Windows). Without this, a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf produces a CRLF working tree, which breaks golden-file tests
# that compare committed fixtures against LF-generating code
# (e.g. TestRenderTextGolden, TestResourceReferenceUpToDate).
#
# `text=auto` lets Git auto-detect text vs. binary, so binary files are left
# untouched; `eol=lf` pins the checkout line ending for detected text files.
* text=auto eol=lf
